the get value else default to zero for a number is a second number if
    it is not the case that nothing is equal to the number
    and the second number is equal to the number
    otherwise the second number is equal to 0.

the area of shape for a shape is a number N if
    the shape is a circle
    and the radius of the shape is a number M
    and N = 3.14159 * M * M
    otherwise the shape is a rectangle
    and the width of the shape is a number K
    and the height of the shape is a number P
    and N = K * P
    otherwise point is equal to the shape
    and N is equal to 0.

